      "rule": "missed_sessions",
      "action": "You skipped Leg Day on 2026-10-02 because of knee soreness after squats — that's the right call. As a result, Quads (7 sets) and Hamstrings (6 sets) are both below the 10-set minimum. Next week, if the knee feels fine, run the missed Leg Day as normal. If it's still sore, swap barbell back squats for a pain-free alternative such as leg press or box squats at a lighter load, and do the same for any squat-pattern movement that aggravates it; keep Romanian deadlift if it's comfortable. If the soreness hasn't cleared up by the time Leg Day comes around, get it checked before loading it again."
    }
  ]
